        <mxCell id="qWLn5vZDrTnf9ysT2-j--1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontFamily=Comic Sans MS;fontStyle=0" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(153, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;How do client know whom to make request?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(128, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;- it selets any one server and sends req to it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(128, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;- if that server is unreachble(timout), it retires to next server&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(128, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;- if leader recvies req, it sends response&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(128, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;- of follower receives req, it sends success=false to client along with the node id of leader, client will recv this leader id, checks for its port, then resends a request&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="330" x="510" y="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
